¬import il from "../../../../../_shared/variables/imageLinks"


#### From the Welcome screen

1. On the welcome screen, click **Open Folder...**. *- red ring*

{{::il.Vscode_WelcomeOpenFolder_img}}


2. A file dialog appears. 

3. Navigate to your project folder (the one containing your `tsmaps`, `docs`, and other folders). *- red ring*

4. Click **Select Folder**. *- yellow ring*

{{::il.Vscode_OpenFolderDialogue_img}}

